  "findings": [
    "Original SNL43 labels M282 large bronze bush and M283 large steel bush; six of each. SNL251 M272 large-bush assembly listing remains a source conflict.",
    "Original SNL137 gives large-planet pin assembly: M313 nut, M284 pin, 3/16 by 2-1/2 inch split pin and 1/2 inch expansion plug. Six assemblies. Do not duplicate pin assembly and pin as physical solids."
  ],
  "correction": "Reinspection for pin construction corrected two earlier note-reading errors: M313 nut and half-inch expansion plug; see transmission_pin_sources.json."
